tches the spec. Overrides now go through the loader's substitution pass before conversion, except for `set_env` and loads with no `conf`. The new `Loader.substitute` raises `NotImplementedError` in the base, and the ini and TOML loaders each implement it. The changelog entry and the `docs/reference/config.rst` subsection are in.\n\nI ran only the spec's one command, not the full test suite.\n\nThe worker flagged two concerns, and I left both as they are:\n- **Error handling:** `substitute` isn't wrapped in `HandledError` the way `build`'s replacer is. A bad substitution in an override could raise an unhandled error instead of a clean message. The spec didn't ask for the wrapping.\n- **Docs placement:** The new docs subsection sits just before \"Escaping dots in override keys\", not at the very end of the override docs.\n\nThe branch was `local-agent/j-20261016-da79b0`. The fast-forward left HEAD at `4224b7ca`.", "ttft_ms": 3133, "type": "result", "duration_ms": 77695, "uuid": "6a45dcb9-0d28-427c-8507-be8466b9739d", "ttft_stream_ms": 2733, "time_to_request_ms": 49, "first_content_frame_ms": 2734, "queued_turn_count": 0, "result_index": 0}
